{"sourceUrl":"https://www.lzdxdyyy.com/Web/SpecialTopic/Detail/0946478a-cb69-36b5-f966-3a23ba8ca09d?rootTypeId=121","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:45.880060+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www.lzdxdyyy.com/Web/SpecialTopic/Detail/0946478a-cb69-36b5-f966-3a23ba8ca09d?rootTypeId=121","html":"<div>\n<p><span><span>为做好第一临床医学院2</span><span>02</span><span>7</span><span>年推免生（直博生）招生录取工作，根据《兰州大学关于做好</span><span>202</span><span>7</span><span>年推免生（直博生）复试录取工作的通知》</span><span>工作要求</span><span>，结合学院实际，特制定本实施细则。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>一、组织领导</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>第一临床医学院研究生招生工作领导小组全面负责学院</span><span>202</span><span>7</span><span>年推免生（直博生）复试录取工作。学院成立若干复试</span><span><span>考核</span></span><span>小组，</span><span>负责相应学科（专业）的</span><span>综合考核工作，包括材料审核、面</span><span>试、思想政治素质和品德考核工作。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、接收条件与程序</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>推免生（直博生）的接收条件和程序严格按照</span><span>《兰州大学关于做好</span><span>202</span><span>7</span><span>年推免生（直博生）复试录取工作的通知》</span><span>执行</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三、</span><span>综合</span><span>考核</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>一</span><span>）</span><span>材料审核</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院按学科专业成立材料审核专家组，每组不少于</span><span>3 人。 专家组成员按照学院材料审核标准对推免生的申请材料进行客观独立打分，填写《兰州大学2027年推免招生材料审核评价表》，汇总后形成最终材料审核成绩。材料审核成绩计入综合考核成绩中。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>二</span><span>）</span><span>面试考核</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>面试考核</span><span>主要考察学生的创新能力、专业素养和综合素质等。为保证推免生（直博生）复试工作的实效性，学院</span><span>采取线上线下等多种方式</span><span>，</span><span>根据报名情况多次组织复试工作。</span><span>综合考核</span><span>内容如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span> 1.直博生：包括</span><span><span>专业面试</span></span><span><span>（满分</span><span>100分）</span></span><span><span>及</span></span><span><span>专业英语测试</span></span><span><span>（满分</span><span>100分）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span><span>.</span><span>学术学位</span><span>硕士</span><span>：包括</span><span><span>专业综合面试（满分</span><span>100分）及外国语口语及听力测试（满分100分）；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span><span>.</span><span>专业学位</span><span>硕士</span><span>：</span><span><span>包括专业综合面试（满分</span><span>100分）、实践</span></span><span><span>技能</span></span><span><span>考核（满分</span><span>100分）及外国语口语及听力测试（满分100分）。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>说明：</span><span>面试考核主要考查学生的创新能力、专业素养和综合素质等</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）思想政治素质和品德考核</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>思想政治素质和品德考核主要是考核推免生（直博生）的现实表现，内容包括考生的政治态度、思想表现、道德品质、遵纪守法、诚实守信、学风及医德医风等方面。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试期间，推免生（直博生）考生须如实填写《复试考生思想政治素质和品德考核情况表》</span><span>及</span><span>《</span><span>兰州大学研究生诚信应试承诺书</span><span>》（</span><span>见附件</span><span>）</span><span>，学院的思想政治素质与品德考核专家通过与考生面谈等方式，直接了解考生政治态度、思想表现、道德品质、遵纪守法、诚实守信、学风及医德医风等方面情况，对考生填写的</span><span>考试违纪、作弊等受处罚情况进行认真核查，并给出考核评语和考核结论。</span><span>考核结果作为录取的首要依据，考核不通过者不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四、体检</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>推免生（直博生）体检统一在新生入学报到时，在我校校医院进行。体检不符合国家入学体检要求的且复检仍不合格的考生将被取消入学资格。体检要求参照《教育部、卫生部、中国残疾人联合会关于印发</span><span>&lt;普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见&gt;的通知》（教学[2003]3号）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、录取</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）按</span><span>综合考核</span><span>成绩从高到低进行录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>直博生</span></span><span><span>：</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>专业英语测试成绩</span>=<span>翻译成绩</span><span>*60%+</span><span>口语交际成绩</span><span>*40% </span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>面试</span></span><span><span>考核</span></span><span><span>成绩</span>=<span>专业面试成绩</span><span>×70%+</span><span>专业英语测试成绩</span><span>×30% </span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>成绩</span>=</span><span><span>材料审评价成绩</span></span><span><span>×</span></span><span>3</span><span>0%</span><span>+</span><span>{<span>专业面试成绩</span><span>×70%+</span><span>（翻译成绩</span><span>*60%+</span><span>口语交际成绩</span><span>*40%</span><span>）</span><span>×30%}×70%</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>硕士</span></span><span><span>：</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>  学术学位：综合考核</span></span><span><span>成绩</span><span>=</span></span><span><span>材料评价成绩</span></span><span><span>×</span></span><span>15</span><span>%</span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>专业</span></span><span><span>综合</span></span><span><span>面试成绩</span><span>×</span></span><span><span>60</span></span><span>%+</span><span><span>外国语口语及听力测试成绩</span></span><span><span>×</span></span><span><span>25</span></span><span>%</span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>专业学位：综合考核</span></span><span><span>成绩</span>=</span><span><span>材料评价成绩</span></span><span><span>×</span></span><span>15</span><span>%</span><span>+<span>专业</span></span><span><span>综合面试成绩</span><span>×</span></span><span>45</span><span>%</span><span>+</span><span><span>外国语口语及听力测试成绩</span><span>×</span></span><span>25</span><span>%+<span>实践</span></span><span><span>技能</span></span><span><span>考核成绩</span><span>×</span></span><span>15</span><span>%<span>。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）有以下情况之一者，不予录取：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.不参加</span><span>综合考核</span><span>者；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span><span>.</span><span>思想政治素质和品德考核不合格者；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.材料审核成绩不合格者（</span><span>＜60 分</span><span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span><span>.外国语口语及听力测试成绩不合格者（＜60 分）； </span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5</span><span>.</span><span><span>实践</span></span><span><span>技能</span></span><span><span>考核成绩不合格者（</span><span>&lt;60分）</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6</span><span>.</span><span>专业综合面试成绩不合格者（＜60 分）； </span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>7</span><span>.</span><span>综合考核</span><span>成绩不合格者（＜60分）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）对未能达到直博生录取要求，但符合我校硕士推免生录取要求者，在本人和招生导师同意的情况下可转报硕士推免生予以录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>六、信息公开公示</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院将严格按照学校要求，在兰州大学第一医院（第一临床医学院）网站（</span><span>https://www.lzdxdyyy.com/Web/Ldyy</span><span>）公布推免生（直博生）复试录取实施细则等信息。复试期间如有疑问通过以下方式联系：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）学院咨询与申诉渠道</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span><span>0931-8625163</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电子邮箱：</span><span>ldyyyjszsb@126.com</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>办公地点：兰州大学第一医院英福楼</span><span>312</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）医学部申诉渠道</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申诉电话：</span><span>0931-8915632</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电子邮箱：</span><a href=\"https://www.lzdxdyyy.com/Web/SpecialTopic/Detail/0946478a-cb69-36b5-f966-3a23ba8ca09d?rootTypeId=121\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>yxyyjs@lzu.edu.cn</span></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span><span>办公地点：兰州大学医学校区恪勤楼</span><span>337室</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）学校申诉渠道</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申诉电话：</span><span>0931-8912168</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电子邮箱：</span><span>yzb@lzu.edu.cn</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>办公地点：兰州市天水南路</span><span>222号贵勤楼B304 室</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>七、未尽事宜按照兰州大学有关文件执行。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>附件1：《</span><span>复试考生思想政治素质和品德考核情况表</span><span>》</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>附件2：</span><span>《</span><span>兰州大学研究生诚信应试承诺书</span><span>》</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>第一临床医学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二</span><span>〇</span><span>二</span><span>六</span><span>年九月</span></span></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"677b54f564bea68c7a8130f7719362b10594e447207656e72c0247412054be5a","textLength":1939,"sourceSha256":"c3fb8cd71a900fc1b0d297be83a8edefa77fa6896fd665143d79ba7372486cc7","selector":"#articleContent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b5319f243ed920603d54","title":"2026年兰州大学第一临床医学院2027年接收推免生（直博生）复试录取实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:45.880060+00:00"}
